# R-052 mutations — 2026-09-25

## Rounds 2-4: scripts/ci/workflowRunsCiRule.ts, each clause disabled alone, against tests/unit/ci/workflowRunsCiRule.test.ts (31 cases) at the round-4 head
The install step is now `bun install --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts`, which closes install
lifecycle scripts (root, workspace member, trusted dependency) as a class. Per-script pins for
prepare/(pre|post)install were dropped as redundant. The cases apply every bypass blind review found
to the real ci.yml and package.json:
- if: false on the step or the job, a shell override, CI_SKIP_BUILD;
- an install without --ignore-scripts, an extra step before or after the gate, or checkout swapped;
- a trigger removed, retargeted, path-filtered, or given branches [master, '!master'];
- a quoted continue-on-error, or a decoy job;
- a no-op ci script, or preci/postci;
- an unknown runs-on label.
G0/G1 test run-ci.sh's bash no-bunfig gate.
