## Round 1 (superseded): the grep-based check-workflow-runs-ci.sh
It caught these four, and blind review then got nine other edits past it, which is why round 2 replaced it.
```
### M0 baseline (unmutated)
exit=0
### M1 step reverted to a hand-listed gate (bun run test:unit)
ERROR: .github/workflows/ci.yml has no step that runs exactly `bun run ci`.
Call run-ci.sh rather than listing its gates: a hand-kept list drifts.
exit=1
### M2 step neutralised with || true
ERROR: .github/workflows/ci.yml has no step that runs exactly `bun run ci`.
Call run-ci.sh rather than listing its gates: a hand-kept list drifts.
exit=1
### M3 continue-on-error added
